Subject: [PATCH] 0003-Update-sun8i_tcon_top.c

Imported from ROCKNIX distribution (projects/ROCKNIX/devices/H700/patches/linux), refreshed for linux 7.2.
Upstream-Status: Pending [ROCKNIX H700 series, https://github.com/ROCKNIX/distribution]
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_tcon_top.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_tcon_top.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_tcon_top.c
index 8adda578c..badb6609d 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_tcon_top.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_tcon_top.c
@@ -179,7 +179,7 @@ static int sun8i_tcon_top_bind(struct device *dev, struct device *master,
 	 * At least on H6, some registers have some bits set by default
 	 * which may cause issues. Clear them here.
 	 */
-	writel(0, regs + TCON_TOP_PORT_SEL_REG);
+	writel(0x20, regs + TCON_TOP_PORT_SEL_REG);
 	writel(0, regs + TCON_TOP_GATE_SRC_REG);
 
